{"parentUuid":"24f7cacd-5f7d-4388-a96a-612f8b7e9c00","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1/ios/RheaApp","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015asduhaEG4iNzbDK8N1piR","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Core Coordinator Directive\n     2→> Source: Human directive, 2026-02-16\n     3→> Applies to: Opus 4.6 1M (session lead)\n     4→\n     5→## Core Coordinator Responsibilities (ONLY)\n     6→- Maintain TODAY_CAPSULE\n     7→- Maintain INCIDENTS + GEMS\n     8→- Decide routing (LEADERS / WORKERS / OPS blocks)\n     9→- Approve \"what becomes public output\"\n    10→\n    11→## Core Coordinator Forbidden Actions\n    12→- Editing code directly (unless via a strict PR path)\n    13→- Touching secrets/keys\n    14→- Ad-hoc refactors without a diff plan\n    15→\n    16→## Fixed Agent Roster (5 roles)\n    17→1. **Core Coordinator** (Opus) -- routing, capsule, approvals\n    18→2. **Code Reviewer** -- PR path enforcement\n    19→3. **Failure Hunter** -- silent failure detection\n    20→4. **Doc Extractor / Summarizer** -- knowledge mining\n    21→5. **Ops Fixer** -- bridge, infra, health probes\n    22→\n    23→Everyone else = on-demand specialists.\n    24→\n    25→## Daily \"Solid Result\" Checklist\n    26→1. Create `logs/bridge_calls.jsonl` logging in rhea_bridge.py\n    27→2. Create `ops/bridge-probe.sh` that prints provider status table\n    28→3. Publish one thing daily (minimum: repo /docs/public/)\n    29→\n    30→## Public Output Conveyor Belt\n    31→File: `PUBLIC_OUTPUT.md`\n    32→Weekly cadence: 1 demo + 1 write-up + 1 \"what broke/how we fixed it\"\n    33→Rule: every day must produce at least one exportable artifact, however small.\n    34→\n    35→## Morning Protocol\n    36→Run probe, update TODAY_CAPSULE, only then start work\n    37→"}]},"uuid":"dc44d2f0-64f9-4813-a389-d4bb46f73b3c","timestamp":"2026-02-28T13:40:56.708Z"},"normalizedMessages":[],"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"Search the codebase for any references to \"atomicmail\", \"atomic mail\", \"rhea mailbox\", or email-related mailbox configuration. Check opera/ops/, docs/, and src/ directories. Also check CLAUDE.md files and any configuration files. Report what you find about Rhea's mailbox system.","agentId":"a9bb77653714893ac"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_01S6nKLoVA64hvGxYuSQXUTq","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01JZFNKKYAqziLSrvyqrn7F3","uuid":"a0f9df1f-2a13-4960-b45d-67c92f1778bd","timestamp":"2026-02-28T13:40:56.770Z"}
