oaded via CLI, the real problem to solve is that Xcode Organizer SSL certificate error, which I should document in a message for Gemini to investigate.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1148,"cache_read_input_tokens":115074,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1148},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYabkaAuTYZwSn9AHnUhv","type":"assistant","uuid":"c30c6791-bdee-4f4e-80c0-ed058318ae58","timestamp":"2026-02-28T14:09:52.595Z"}
