{"parentUuid":"159193b7-98a6-462a-97b8-5661288a2e9e","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01C2QZfJyTvKPJXjqECHttwQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pushed. \n\nSo — real priorities, de-overloaded:\n\n| # | What | Status | Next action |\n|---|------|--------|-------------|\n| 1 | **TestFlight on your phone** | Build 5 processing | Go to App Store Connect → TestFlight → add Internal Testing group → add yourself → install |\n| 2 | **Server actually works** | `.env` not sourced, providers dead | Restart tribunal with `. .env && python3 src/tribunal_api.py` |\n| 3 | **Dialog is useful** | Shell only — sends to office, no LLM response | Wire `/tribunal` behind the dialog so it actually answers questions |\n\nEverything else is P2+. What matters is: TestFlight install + server running + dialog that talks back."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":172,"cache_read_input_tokens":147327,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":172},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYaf3wUdrpN41akLMQgCH","type":"assistant","uuid":"55a97a7e-040a-440f-8161-f2309db44d55","timestamp":"2026-02-28T14:52:54.629Z"}
