{"parentUuid":"16052602-8bd5-43c8-816f-e6774869c219","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PibZZ48Bb5LKi1WrJo3ZeD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is showing me screenshots from their iOS app running on a real device (TestFlight build). Let me analyze what I see:\n\n1. **Screen Broadcast** - Recording screen\n2. **Dialog tab** - Shows the Dialog view with agent picker (SHARED, REX, ORION, GEMINI, HYPERION) - empty, dark theme working\n3. **Another Dialog screenshot** - Same, empty\n4. **Radio tab** - Shows \"Radio\" with some status info, toggle switches\n5. **Governor tab** - Appears blank/white - this is a problem\n\nKey observations:\n- The app IS running on device (TestFlight works!)\n\n\n- The Dialog tab renders but is empty because it's still pointing at `/office/send` instead of `/dialog`, and the API might not be reachable from the device anyway\n- The Radio tab has some content showing\n- The Governor tab is completely blank/white, which is the main bug I need to fix\n\nI should start by wiring the DialogView to the correct `/dialog` endpoint, then investigate what's causing the Governor tab to render as a blank white screen.\n\nBut wait—the user is testing on a real device, so `apiBaseURL` needs to point to the actual server, not localhost. I need to check what `AppConfig.defaultAPIBaseURL` is currently set to.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7322,"cache_read_input_tokens":54883,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7322},"output_tokens":11,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYagwpGNBcoLJQ7YpX1my","type":"assistant","uuid":"36f7ab61-ab22-